"""Selected CJK lexical responses: intention/desire, suspended activity,
and numbered occurrences. This is a spelling-sensitive approximation, not
a detector of every synonym: fused words such as 欲望 are left alone.
It also recognizes 慾 and 滯 when byte tokens finish those characters.
Unrecognized first tokens get a small positive document-start offset;
other unrecognized tokens get zero, omitting weak lexical effects.
